[162.939966, "o", "supervise: reindex incomplete; run it again to continue\r\nAUDIT: 352 committed rows; complete=False\r\nsupervise: reindex started pid=303 budget=10s grace=5s\r\n2026-11-22 18:36:25,385 reindex.worker INFO starting after id 596 (352/5739 docs done)\r\nsupervise: budget of 10s reached, sending SIGTERM\r\n2026-11-22 18:36:35,412 reindex.worker INFO stopped safely: last_id=1242 docs=742/5739\r\nsupervise: reindex stopped after 10.1s (rc=75)\r\nsupervise: reindex incomplete; run it again to continue\r\nAUDIT: 742 committed rows; complete=False\r\nsupervise: reindex started pid=315 budget=10s grace=5s\r\n2026-11-22 18:36:35,765 reindex.worker INFO starting after id 1242 (742/5739 docs done)\r\nsupervise: budget of 10s reached, sending SIGTERM\r\n2026-11-22 18:36:45,686 reindex.worker INFO stopped safely: last_id=1888 docs=1152/5739\r\nsupervise: reindex stopped after 10.0s (rc=75)\r\nsupervise: reindex incomplete; run it again to continue\r\nAUDIT: 1152 committed rows; complete=False\r\nsupervise: reindex started pid=364 budget=10s grace=5s\r\n202"]
